        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D9000A, Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHigh security heavy duty single cylinder stainless steel deadbolt from Omnia. For more than 40 years, Omnia's line of Stainless Steel products have been designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired. The Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt is strong and durable, made from premium grade material and coupled with interior components that prove worthy of Omnia's exceptional standards. The Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt has a brushed stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-MIDTOWN-SN-SM.jpg?v=1704354608\" width=\"600\" height=\"226\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia D9000A Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-stainless-steel-deadbolt-omnia-d9000ac\"><b>Omnia D9000AC Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>High security 1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 cylinders with collar, 1 thumbturn, deadbolt assembly, faceplate, reinforced armored strike with 3\" long screws, and dust box.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Square Brushed Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Overall Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Thumbturn Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "Omnia D9000 Stainless Steel Deadbolt - High security heavy duty stainless steel deadbolt from Omnia. Satin Stainless Steel Finish, fits standard pre-drilled doors. Single Cylinder (Keyed lock on the outside with thumbturn inside). Available for doors up to 3-1/4 inch thick.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-D9000A Omnia Stainless Steel Deadbolts, Omnia D9000A  single cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolts, stainless steel dead bolts, single cylinder deadbolts,  omnia deadbolts satin stainless steel, d9000a38.38, d9000a34.38, d9000a38.34, d9000a34.34, d9000ac38.38, d9000ac34.38, d9000ac38.34, d9000ac34.34, thick door deadbolts, locks for thick doors, stainless steel deadbolt for thick doors, keyed locks,"
